ns by about 4.2% this quarter. [1][2]",detail:"Most of the impact sits in supply chain logistics rather than in demand. Diverting the affected lanes through Vietnam could absorb the larger part of it next quarter. [2]"},brief:{title:"Q4 route adjustment",facts:[{label:"Affected",value:"Three shipping lanes"},{label:"Proposed route",value:"Via Vietnam"},{label:"Planning window",value:"Q4 logistics"}]},sources:[{title:"Regional revenue model",reference:"market_data · apac.revenue · fy26.q3",description:"The APAC revenue model provides the regional context for this Q3 tariff analysis. Vietnam and Malaysia account for the larger part of the exposed revenue in the scenario."},{title:"Tariff scenario forecast",reference:"forecast_v3 · run 42 · tariff scenario",description:"Run 42 estimates a 4.2% margin contraction this quarter. The scenario identifies supply chain logistics as the main driver and proposes rerouting affected lanes through Vietnam."},{title:"Governed tariff schedule",reference:"tariff schedule · 2026-08 · governed",description:"The governed August 2026 tariff schedule is read alongside the regional revenue model and forecast in this illustrative analysis."}],action:{title:"Reroute the affected lanes through Vietnam",description:"Changes the Q4 logistics plan for three lanes. Proposed by the agent; nothing moves until a person approves it."}},{id:"gateway",label:"Gateway check",title:"Payment gateway compliance",scope:"Platform · Security",prior:{user:"Summarise the open findings from the last audit.",agent:"One finding stayed open after the last audit: an ISO 27001 variance on two gateway endpoints, assigned to platform security. [1]"},user:"Is the payment gateway compliant with the new regulations?",analysis:"Reading the gateway configuration against the control set.",tools:[{name:"gateway_config",detail:"read · prod · 14 endpoints",took:"0.4s"},{name:"compliance_scan",detail:"ISO 27001 control set",took:"1.6s"}],answer:{lead:"Yes. All fourteen endpoints 